 * current debugging level.
 *
 * EXTERNAL VARIABLES:
 *  < gnirsDebugLevel  long       Current debugging level.
 *                                For details see "gnirsLogMessage" above.
 *
 * REQUIREMENTS:
 *
 * DEFICIENCIES:
 *
 * Author:
 * Steven Beard  (smb@roe.ac.uk)
 *
 * History:
 * 14-Jan-1997: Original version.                  (smb)
 *-
